{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TASTE RURAL LIFE </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mornings are full of dust, sun, and herbs. Draw water from the well, take out the trash, sweep the yard, pull cobwebs from the corners, chop vegetables for Shopska Salad, and put things back where they belong - fixing up Grandma\u2019s house one small step at a time. It\u2019s the perfect place to breathe and leave the heavy urban life behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/514864728b1e2e1dd8d007d9031e7453.poster.avif?t=1768765712\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/514864728b1e2e1dd8d007d9031e7453.webm?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/514864728b1e2e1dd8d007d9031e7453.mp4?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRING THE HOMESTEAD BACK TO LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The House is asking for a little care and love. There is a lot to mend and a lot to tend, and every small change makes it feel warmer, calmer, more like home. Like they say - <i>Home Sweet Home</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/60fd669e4dbb1dec153e21dbd2ebd78d.poster.avif?t=1768765712\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/60fd669e4dbb1dec153e21dbd2ebd78d.webm?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/60fd669e4dbb1dec153e21dbd2ebd78d.mp4?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAS THE HOUSE CHANGED?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dark, it\u2019s in your best interest to check if everything is where it should be - if anything is missing, or if something new has shown up. Sometimes it is only a small thing... still, you better notice it faster than IT does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/1f1e6e2d821fa92ff85ce08bcfebb34f.poster.avif?t=1768765712\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/1f1e6e2d821fa92ff85ce08bcfebb34f.webm?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/1f1e6e2d821fa92ff85ce08bcfebb34f.mp4?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW TO MAKE IT THROUGH THE NIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot anomalies, eat the Shopska Salad - just like Grandma taught you. And if everything is in its place, put it in the fridge for tomorrow. It\u2019s a simple habit, but you should not take it lightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/493e6dd65681e8161555c5e05f624d8d.poster.avif?t=1768765712\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/493e6dd65681e8161555c5e05f624d8d.webm?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/493e6dd65681e8161555c5e05f624d8d.mp4?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE TRUTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time, things come to light that villagers do not want to talk about. The longer you live here, the clearer it gets: Grandma knew something - and the house remembers, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/90caec55c9b3b1b3fcd7857e27f7a42d.poster.avif?t=1768765712\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/90caec55c9b3b1b3fcd7857e27f7a42d.webm?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/extras/90caec55c9b3b1b3fcd7857e27f7a42d.mp4?t=1768765712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768800?t=1768765712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/e6a4c14d66ec2917216c6028c270186e159e54de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768765712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/5d70e5df99182df3f358ecae9d32e86c23439e82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768765712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768800/5d70e5df99182df3f358ecae9d32e86c23439e82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768765712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharin